Third-party software bundled in the distributed container images / rootfs
(docs/log/35 §35.4.1). License texts ship with each component inside the image
(/usr/share/doc/<pkg>/copyright for Debian packages, or the component's own
distribution). Proprietary agent CLIs (Claude Code, GitHub Copilot CLI,
Antigravity CLI) are NOT bundled — deployments fetch them directly from their
official distribution channels at first start (boot-install).

Base system and utilities (Debian GNU/Linux, via the node:22-bookworm images):
