  git (GPL-2.0), git-lfs (MIT), subversion (Apache-2.0), tmux (ISC),
  vim (Vim license), curl (curl license), wget (GPL-3.0), OpenSSH client
  (BSD-style), GnuPG (GPL-3.0), ripgrep (MIT), fd-find (MIT/Apache-2.0),
  bat (MIT/Apache-2.0), jq (MIT), htop (GPL-2.0), procps (GPL-2.0/LGPL-2.1),
  strace (LGPL-2.1), unzip/zip (Info-ZIP), GCC toolchain / build-essential
  (GPL-3.0 with GCC Runtime Library Exception), Python 3 (PSF-2.0),
  fontconfig (MIT-style), DejaVu fonts (Bitstream Vera / Arev licenses),
  Noto CJK fonts (SIL OFL 1.1).

